    "title": "Hair Dye",
    "description": "Are you up for the best hair challenge ever? What hairstyle or haircut do you want in this girls hair salon 3d game? What hair color? Mix colors and find out! Which hair dye? Ready for the #1 rainbow hair color changer challenge? Grab your hair dye, hair color, mix colors for your favorite hairstyle & haircut and get to work at the girls hair salon 3d game. Dye crazy hairstyles, mix colors with the hair color changer and add beautiful decorations for a fancy rainbow girls haircut. Add crazy rainbow color to amazing hairstyles. Ready to get styling? And most importantly, are you ready for the best hair challenge in the hair salon? \r\nYour hair salon has tons of customers waiting for your unique hairstyles, haircuts, and unique hair dye. Become a part of the coolest hair challenge to get the best hair dye and haircut!\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
